{"title":"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_12\">Problem 12</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 12\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3f4dedfac6afcc04d5f4f5315e4ae2e41cb3b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_1 = a^2 + 2^a + a \\cdot 2^{(a+1)/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb465e39011f366642694ceb39a60d832eafaed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_2 = a^2 + 2^a - a \\cdot 2^{(a+1)/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a21aa721dfc709d9c4db4b4bff390c820549f3c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le a \\le 251$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />, how many integral values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are there such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92aa0febb865f62df1280848c527e85a0e10a94d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_1 \\cdot d_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/cea171bfac003b9497fc76bf9525eb81e7d289cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}[(a^2 + 2^a) + a \\cdot 2^{(a+1)/2}][(a^2 + 2^a) - a \\cdot 2^{(a+1)/2}] &amp;= (a^2 + 2^a)^2 - a^2 \\cdot 2^{a+1}\\\\ &amp;= a^4 + 2 \\cdot a^22^{a} + 2^{2a} - a^2 \\cdot 2^{a+1}\\\\ &amp;= a^4 + 2^{2a}\\end{align*}\" width=\"614\" height=\"73\" />\n</p><p>(If you recall the reverse of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sophie_Germain_Identity\" title=\"Sophie Germain Identity\">Sophie Germain Identity</a> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f2772795e324ae0818dd69339b027977bb5e904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=a,\\, b = 2^{(a-1)/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />, then you could have directly found the answer).\n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fermat%27s_Little_Theorem\" title=\"Fermat&#39;s Little Theorem\">Fermat's Little Theorem</a>, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3e24b4fa4391ba12223baad47a6a19ef95867c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{4} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"19\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cec7d4ce5fecc714837f1fe54b7c8b1f5ba056fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\nmid 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8aab51ff16b394b3d8e4304ce4f18200d008e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{4} \\equiv 0 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"19\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434fb456efa65d3d37cf7b9e68079648975e6aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a | 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" />. Also, we note that by examining a couple of terms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de581ea59081c3a0f0a08b15b5826d6117b7402e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2a} \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"19\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a157ef88aef444a6eb099322d2d8fcfabee5e55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\nmid 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22acaef26ee1c03a85545aff47cb2c68b6859654.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2a} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"19\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/7/9874451907ffa23e3f23eecf1e9a3a26cd8882e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a|2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef103f9a442d11c72c54040783eee9ef5aa5bb04.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{4} + 2^{2a} \\equiv \\{0,1\\} + \\{1,4\\} \\equiv \\{0,1,2,4\\} \\pmod{5}\\]\" width=\"381\" height=\"19\" />\nWith divisibility by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> achievable only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/5/d7580b8fef95ba6d58a33cfce00c77da92db0845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\nmid 2,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/b/01bca3912350b9b4fa565fbf731b22c9ffba6246.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{251-1}{2}+1 = 126$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"144\" height=\"37\" /> odd numbers in the range given, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a634d6b86fe96917922a26b2af79cedb7aa27f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{245-5}{10}+1 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"135\" height=\"38\" /> of those are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/9453ef1691a2aa5ac99d977a31d5985d1242ad6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$126 - 25 = \\boxed{101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008\">Mock AIME 1 2007-2008</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=196980\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203600\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal